  {
    "id": "tab-nuki-01",
    "type": "tab",
    "label": "Nuki Lock — Matter Test",
    "disabled": false,
    "info": "Test flow for node-red-contrib-matter.\n\n## First-time setup\n1. In Apple Home → Nuki lock → Share Access → Open Commissioning Window.\n2. Copy the pairing code shown.\n3. Edit the 'Pairing Code' inject node and replace '12345-678-9012' with your code.\n4. Deploy and click the inject button — check the debug panel for the nodeId.\n5. Update the nodeId in ALL command/read/subscribe nodes to match.\n\n## DoorLock cluster\n- Cluster ID: 0101\n- Endpoint: 1 (typical)\n- Commands: lockDoor, unlockDoor\n- Attribute: lockState (0=NotFullyLocked, 1=Locked, 2=Unlocked, 3=Unlatched)"
  },

  {
    "id": "comment-commission",
